{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X的音乐细节与感受出现时机不如Y细腻，尤其缺少随乐句逐步显现的体验。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的优势是故事因果和心理转折交代得更完整，观众能顺着文字理解他为什么从心动、克制、害怕失去，一步步走向坦然；左右分工也让叙事和感受容易分别扫读。Y的重点加亮确实更容易抓住，但部分短时段堆积了大量感受词，例如S01、S05、S10，实际扫屏时容易来不及消化；而且一些心理动机和前后转折被压缩了。Y在音乐细节、感官层次和乐句同步方面明显胜出，但综合理解与观看负担，我更倾向X。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "6104aba1-7ec3-4e66-be88-5b4598cae2c0", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T002432383830Z", "elapsed_seconds": 69.703, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T00:25:42.104567+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "94ed9bb40a30d9f45172124351fb6f758ea59b17607d4c94790707ba1d1e799e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachmen